  <trk>
    <name>616 Biketicket to ride red</name>
    <desc><![CDATA[The closure in the Bruchhalda area is locally detoured and the route is normally passable.  / This allmountain route offers a lot of variety for experienced bikers. The fast descents on narrow trails provide great riding fun, and the final ride from Parpan over Grida to Chur turns out to be a secret tip.]]></desc>
    <type>mountainbiking</type>
